<title>JAPAN: Tesco -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tesco -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.46		vs	   16.94</p>
<p> Operating	  547    million	  vs	  415    million</p>
<p> Current	    544    million	  vs	  402    million</p>
<p> Net		  230    million	  vs	  160    million</p>
<p> EPS		   17.75 yen	  vs	   12.31 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     13 million	  vs	  13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tesco Co Ltd makes PVC wallpaper and does construction and repair work for the Skylark group, of which it is a member.</p>
</text>
